.TH SCC 1 "2026-03-06" "Sentinel-CC 4.2.0" "Sentinel-CC Manual"
.SH NAME
scc \- unified command-line interface for Sentinel-CC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scc
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ args... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B scc
is a git-style CLI that provides a single entry point to the entire
Sentinel-CC toolchain: compiling, signing, running, benchmarking,
testing, and monitoring protected binaries.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B build \fIsource.c\fR [\fB\-o\fR \fIoutput\fR]
Compile a C source file with the SentinelPass LLVM plugin, then
sign the resulting binary with Ed25519.
Additional compiler flags can be passed directly.
.TP
.B sign \fIbinary\fR
Sign an already-instrumented binary with Ed25519.
Requires \fIpriv.pem\fR in the project directory.
.TP
.B run \fR[\fIloader-opts\fR] \fIbinary\fR [\fIargs...\fR]
Run a binary under Sentinel-CC eBPF protection.
All options are forwarded to the loader (e.g. \fB\-\-audit\fR,
\fB\-\-fexit\fR, \fB\-\-kill\fR).
Requires root.
.TP
.B ui \fR[\fIloader-opts\fR] \fIbinary\fR [\fIargs...\fR]
Run a binary under Sentinel protection and pipe audit output to
the live TUI dashboard.
Equivalent to: sentinel-loader --audit --audit-format=json ... | sentinel-tui.
Requires root.
.TP
.B bench \fR[\fIbinary\fR] [\fB\-n\fR \fIiterations\fR]
Run the latency benchmark. Compares native vs Sentinel-enforced
syscall latency and reports overhead in ns/syscall.
Defaults to \fIvictim_bench\fR if no binary is specified.
Requires root.
.TP
.B test
Run the full automated test suite (ELF integrity, signature
verification, tamper detection, all enforcement phases).
Requires root.
.TP
.B dump \fIbinary\fR
Inspect the embedded Sentinel policy of a binary.
Wraps \fBsentinel-dump\fR(1).
.TP
.B features
Display the full feature matrix of the current Sentinel-CC build.
.TP
.B status
Check system readiness: kernel version, BTF availability, required
tools, keys, and built binaries.
.TP
.B version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.B help
Show usage information.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
# Build and protect a program
scc build myapp.c -o myapp
scc run ./myapp

# Live monitoring with TUI dashboard
sudo scc ui ./myapp

# Run benchmarks
sudo scc bench

# Check system readiness
scc status

# View all features
scc features

# Inspect policy
scc dump ./myapp
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B scc
looks for Sentinel-CC tools first in the project directory (development
mode), then in
.IR PATH
(installed mode).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Error (missing tool, bad arguments, runtime failure).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sentinel-loader (1),
.BR sentinel-sign (1),
.BR sentinel-dump (1),
.BR sentinel-tui (1)
